 "remarks": "SELLERS REQUEST HIGHEST AND BEST OFFERS BY SUNDAY 8/9/26 @ 8 PM.  This beautifully kept and updated ranch in great location on a quiet road is move-in ready! Sited on a serene third of an acre with level, fenced yard offers peaceful, low-maintenance living on one level. Entry to bright and spacious living room with dining area and bay window; fresh and inviting kitchen with eating space at island, bay window, granite counters, wainscotting and stainless steel appliances. Primary Bedroom is quite large with ceiling fan and two, double closets and sitting area; full bath w/good-size shower stall and tiled floor; laundry room. Second bedroom (currently used as a den) with built-in TV Space, double closet and sliders to backyard; third bedroom with newer carpeting. Most of the house has six-panel doors, crown moldings and much more. Newer (approx. 2 years) propane HVAC system, Roof (approx. 13 Years). Welcome home! Contingent upon probate approval.",
